sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Modal as Export Modal
    participant API as FastAPI Endpoint
    participant Gen as HTML Generator
    participant FS as File System (.vista/)
    participant Browser

    User->>Modal: Click "Export Documentation"
    Modal->>API: GET /api/projects/{id}/export/features
    API->>FS: Scan features for diagrams & requirements
    FS-->>API: Feature list with content indicators
    API-->>Modal: Feature tree data (JSON)
    Modal->>Modal: Render tree checklist

    User->>Modal: Select features & diagrams
    User->>Modal: Click "Download"
    Modal->>API: POST /api/projects/{id}/export
    Note right of Modal: Body: { features: [{ name, diagrams: [...] }] }

    API->>Gen: Generate HTML with selected content
    Gen->>FS: Read _arch.json manifests
    FS-->>Gen: Diagram metadata
    Gen->>FS: Read .mmd diagram files
    FS-->>Gen: Diagram source code
    Gen->>FS: Read domain-requirements.md
    FS-->>Gen: Requirements markdown
    Gen->>Gen: Render Jinja2 export template
    Gen-->>API: Complete HTML string
    API-->>Browser: Response (Content-Disposition: attachment)
    Browser->>User: File download starts
